<title>TURKEY: Turkey sees bumper corn crop, plans import levy.</title>
<headline>Turkey sees bumper corn crop, plans import levy.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey is expected to produce a bumper corn crop of up to 2.2 million tonnes in 1996/97, up from 1.8 million a year ago, and officials said the government was planning to impose a levy on corn imports due to the increase in output.</p>
</text>
